    "Local ASan/UBSan cohorts use detect_leaks=0 for the ptrace executor; explicit resource-accounting checks remain enabled.",
    "These standalone recipes compose over the frozen Timecard union. They must be applied additively to any later cumulative selection, without replacing newer components."
